  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1724179062_4284771_1854d8953f09fb4ecc755290befc336e.png",
  "description": "<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\r\n<div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"588026db-b7fb-4621-8c26-50db8f9cea1d\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\r\n<p><strong>Unlock Earnings with Liv'n Legacy: Earn 10% Commission on Every Sale!</strong></p>\r\n<p>Ready to turn your passion for fashion and jewelry into a profitable venture? Join the Liv'n Legacy team and start earning a 10% commission on every item you sell! Whether you're a fashion enthusiast, a savvy marketer, or just someone looking for a fun and rewarding side hustle, this opportunity is for you.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Why Sell for Liv'n Legacy?</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Generous Commissions</strong>: Earn 10% on every sale! The more you sell, the more you make&mdash;it's that simple.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Premium Products</strong>: Represent a brand known for its high-quality jewelry and apparel, making it easy to attract and retain customers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Flexibility &amp; Freedom</strong>: Work on your own terms, set your own schedule, and sell at your own pace&mdash;whether online, in-person, or both!</li>\r\n<li><strong>Exclusive Perks</strong>: Get early access to new collections, special discounts, and be part of an exciting community of sellers.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Support &amp; Resources</strong>: Benefit from marketing materials, training, and a supportive network to help you succeed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Imagine earning extra income simply by sharing products you love! With Liv'n Legacy, you get to be your own boss while enjoying the thrill of selling beautiful, in-demand items. Every sale brings you closer to bigger rewards, so why wait? Start selling today and watch your earnings grow!</p>\r\n<p><strong>Ready to Join?</strong><br>Sign up now and start your journey with Liv'n Legacy. Your success story starts with one sale&mdash;let&rsquo;s make it happen!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden -ml-2\">\r\n<div class=\"items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><button class=\"rounded-lg text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary\"><span class=\"flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"icon-md-heavy\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M11 4.91a.5.5 0 0 0-.838-.369L6.676 7.737A1 1 0 0 1 6 8H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2a1 1 0 0 1 .676.263l3.486 3.196A.5.5 0 0 0 11 19.09zM8.81 3.067C10.415 1.597 13 2.735 13 4.91v14.18c0 2.175-2.586 3.313-4.19 1.843L5.612 18H4a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V9a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h1.611zm11.507 3.29a1 1 0 0 1 1.355.401A10.96 10.96 0 0 1 23 12c0 1.85-.458 3.597-1.268 5.13a1 1 0 1 1-1.768-.934A8.96 8.96 0 0 0 21 12a8.96 8.96 0 0 0-1.085-4.287 1 1 0 0 1 .402-1.356M15.799 7.9a1 1 0 0 1 1.4.2 6.48 6.48 0 0 1 1.3 3.9c0 1.313-.39 2.537-1.06 3.56a1 1 0 0 1-1.673-1.096A4.47 4.47 0 0 0 16.5 12a4.47 4.47 0 0 0-.9-2.7 1 1 0 0 1 .2-1.4\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button></span><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><button class=\"rounded-lg text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary\"><span class=\"flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"icon-md-heavy\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M7 5a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h9a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v9a3 3 0 0 1-3 3h-2v2a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H5a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-9a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h2zm2 2h5a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v5h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-9